## Command

```shell
biome format --write file.md docs/file.md
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["docs/**"],
      "markdown": {
        "formatter": {
          "formatEmbeds": false
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## `docs/file.md`

```md
```js
const   value   =   {a:1,b:2}
```

```

## `file.md`

```md
```js
const value = { a: 1, b: 2 };
```

```

